### 8. Risk Management

| Risk                              | Possible Impact                  | Mitigation                                     |
| --------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |
| Requirement changes               | Development delays               | Finalize major requirements early              |
| Database errors                   | Loss or incorrect data           | Perform validation and regular backups         |
| AI recommendations are inaccurate | Poor user experience             | Test recommendation rules using sample data    |
| Software bugs                     | System malfunction               | Perform testing after each module              |
| Integration problems              | Modules may not work together    | Conduct incremental integration                |
| Data security issues              | Unauthorized access to user data | Use authentication and secure password storage |
| Schedule delays                   | Late project completion          | Track progress using milestones                |
| Technical difficulties            | Development slowdown             | Use well-documented and suitable technologies  |

